• Which circular business model best supports the remanufacturing of our product: leasing, sharing, or pay-per-use?
• How will we recover products at end of use — through buy-back, deposit schemes, or contractual return?
• What is the total cost of ownership across multiple lifecycles, and how does it compare to a linear model?
• How can we communicate the value of remanufactured products to customers?
• What partnerships are needed to support the reverse supply chain?